Description: list the stereo picture types in Gwenview's desktop files
 MPO, JPS and PNS are sub-classes of JPEG and PNG (kimageformats-stereo.xml
 in kf6-kimageformats). The edition makes Gwenview their default
 (/etc/xdg/kde-mimeapps.list in sparky-stereo-look); naming them in the
 desktop entry and the part's service makes Open With and the default list
 Gwenview for these types directly instead of by inheritance only.
Author: Daniel Campos Ramos <Capitain_Jack@yahoo.com>
Forwarded: not-needed

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -216,6 +216,9 @@ set(IMAGE_MIME_TYPES_LIST
     image/svg+xml
     image/svg+xml-compressed
     application/x-krita
+    image/x-jps
+    image/x-mpo
+    image/x-pns
 )
 if (KF6KDcraw_FOUND)
     list(APPEND IMAGE_MIME_TYPES_LIST
